# Windsurf Cascade Rules for Shiro X Dev/boost Mode

Trigger: `/boost`

1. Worktree Isolation: Initialize ephemeral sandbox worktree via `bash scripts/boost-runner.sh init`.
2. Diagnostic First: Inspect AST symbols and create a failing test case before patching code.
3. Automated Verification: Execute `bash scripts/boost-verify.sh`.
4. Auto-Heal: Loop up to 5 times on compiler/test errors.
5. Reconcile & Report: Merge verified branch and output real test run statistics.
